        <mxCell id="rejlbl" value="&lt;b&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 12px&quot; color=&quot;#F37021&quot;&gt;REJECTED — fanning a live feed out over CarSky's video pin&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 11px&quot; color=&quot;#3d3d46&quot;&gt;Container ↔ Container: the video pin is an iceoryx2 shared-memory transport carrying raw RGBA — ≈ 70 MB/s at 720p20, with no C++ helper and an undocumented frame header.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 11px&quot; color=&quot;#3d3d46&quot;&gt;Container → Skycraft: the guest side of a video pin is one sentence in the platform doc — no wiring example, no named counterpart, no camera HAL. Unusable inside the deadline.&lt;/font&gt;" style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=wrap;spacingLeft=0;spacingRight=0;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="44" y="708" width="1240" height="66" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="legend" value="" style="rounded=1;arcSize=8;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#19226D;strokeWidth=1.6;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;spacingTop=6;spacingLeft=8;spacingRight=8;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="24" y="802" width="1272" height="184" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="leghdr" value="&lt;b&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 12px&quot; color=&quot;#19226D&quot;&gt;LEGEND — every R-number is a requirement ID from the report §2. There is no separate &quot;message&quot; numbering.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 11px&quot; color=&quot;#3d3d46&quot;&gt;R1–R6 are the CONTRACT requirements: each one's deliverable is a schema or a topology — which is why &quot;the R2 message&quot; or &quot;an R3 object&quot; reads like a message name. It is shorthand for the artifact that requirement defines. R7–R19 are BEHAVIOURAL requirements: the deliverable is running code.&lt;/font&gt;" style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=wrap;spacingLeft=0;spacingRight=0;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="44" y="812" width="1240" height="40" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
